    "en": {
      "trackName": "Touch Round - Watch game",
      "description": "How to play?\n- For iPhone and iPad, depending the circuit, tap the right side of the screen to turn right, tap the left side of the screen to turn left.\n- For Apple Watch, move the \"Digital Crown\" wheel\n\n2 versions of the game:\n- Version 2: More complete version. The cars have realistic physics, with drifting, rev counter, gear change... \n- Version 1: Simpler version. the original game for Apple Watch. Constant velocity.\n\nA fast racing game designed for Apple Watch.\n\nFor now more than 20 circuits and 40 cars to choose, all with different characteristics.\n\nDo you want to compete against your friends? You can send the score obtained on the iPhone and Apple Watch to the Game Center leaderboard.\n\nTo submit the Apple Watch score to the ranking:\n1- The iPhone and Apple Watch must be linked.\n2- Play with the Apple Watch and before sending the score, open the app on the iPhone (It's important to open the iPhone app after playing with the watch). When you press \"Send Score\" from Apple Watch, a screen on the iPhone with the score will be ready to send.\n\nNow you can know if you are the fastest player on the Apple Watch!",
      "releaseNotes": "This update introduces optional premium content to help support ongoing development and future game updates. Thank you for playing and for supporting the project!",
