    },
    {
      "version": "3.2.1",
      "releaseNotes": "- The simulation of your best lap is saved, you can compete against yourself with the ghost mode.\n- The best local times are restarted to be able to save the simulation of the new times\n- The intelligence of the opponents in the race mode continues to be improved.",
      "seenAt": "2023-01-16T22:05:37Z"
    },
